Subject: Drop the SlowTestDetector phpunit extension bootstrap

Ergebnis\PHPUnit\SlowTestDetector\Extension is a require-dev-only
composer dependency (a slow-test reporter, not something any test
assertion depends on). This build never runs composer install for
dev dependencies, so the class is never available, and
tests/phpunit.xml's failOnWarning="true" turns the resulting
"Cannot bootstrap extension" warning into a hard test-suite failure.
Drop the bootstrap entry so the extension is simply not loaded.

Forwarded: not-needed
---
Index: rc-build/tests/phpunit.xml
===================================================================
--- rc-build.orig/tests/phpunit.xml
+++ rc-build/tests/phpunit.xml
@@ -14,9 +14,6 @@
       <directory>../plugins</directory>
     </include>
   </source>
-  <extensions>
-    <bootstrap class="Ergebnis\PHPUnit\SlowTestDetector\Extension"/>
-  </extensions>
   <testsuites>
     <testsuite name="tests">
       <directory>.</directory>
